  "description": "There will be happy and joyful days, but there will also be sad, regretful, and disappointing days. Still, if you don’t give up and put in a little effort, sometimes you’ll be able to meet a ‘today, day’ that you really like.”\n\nEvery night, a secret operation by Heart and Gummies for their beloved day begins! A cheeky and warm nighttime problem-solving growth project by the bedside attachment doll ‘Heart’ and colorful Gummi friends! A super cute and super deep, heart-healing adventure that unfolds every night. We invite you to the secret counseling.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
